# State and plans may hold resource details; never commit them.
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
*.tfplan
.terraform/
crash.log
# Per-environment values and keys (the CloudFront private key goes to SSM, never to disk long-term).
terraform.tfvars
*.pem
# Generated runtime inputs (image digests of the last publish, envs/dev evidence settings): local to who runs the lab.
*.auto.tfvars.json
